From 53a1d6b1b7162644b6660af739497206bee8b88f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:29:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): resume timed review waits for exact-head repair
 [daveey]

Timed waits only admitted approvals, leaving request_changes owners held active_pr. Accept named exact-current-head change requests as one repair continuation without changing merge or CI gates. Require claimed owner provenance and every awaited review to provide valid scope/head evidence; consume the continuation on the next executed claim.

Proof: two original deadlock tests RED, unclaimed-owner negative RED; 116 awaited-review tests GREEN. scripts/check --base origin/main: all 20 checks pass.
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_awaited_review.py           |  35 ++---
 .../test_kanban_active_pr_awaited_review.py   |   5 +-
 .../test_kanban_awaited_review_repair.py      | 124 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 147 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_awaited_review_repair.py

diff --git a/hermes_cli/kanban_awaited_review.py b/hermes_cli/kanban_awaited_review.py
